==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|по-|ложи́ть}}. Compare {{cog|sh|положити}}, {{cog|pl|położyć}}, {{cog|cs|položit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|положи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-положить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|положи́ть|pf|impf=полага́ть,класть}}

# to [[put]], to [[lay]], to [[lay]] down, to [[deposit]] (In a horizontal position)
#: {{ux|ru|'''положи́ть''' [[коне́ц]] [[страдание|страда́ниям]]|'''to put''' an end to the sufferings}}
# to [[apply]]
# to [[spend]]

====Usage notes====
* The imperfective form {{m|ru|ложи́ть}} (''without any prefixes and reflexive suffixes'') is considered non-standard in the modern Russian, {{m|ru|класть}} should be used instead.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4c+p|положи́ть|impr_sg2=поло́жь1|impr_pl2=поло́жьте1||notes=1 Colloquial}}

